  "description": "Shared abstractions for the Sdcb.SimdCodecs image codec family: IImageDecoder (magic-byte sniff + fidelity decode + zero-copy decode into RGBA / BGRA / RGB / BGR / grey at any stride), IMultiFrameImageDecoder / IImageFrameReader (animation frames and document pages, by index), IDecodedImage / RasterImage (a codec-neutral decoded raster) and PixelConverter (SIMD layout conversion). Ships the ITU-T H.273 colour vocabulary (ColorPrimaries / TransferFunction / MatrixCoefficients) and a ColorEncoding record surfacing what decoded samples mean (sRGB, PQ/HLG HDR, linear light). AOT-compatible, zero runtime dependencies.",
